Please use the QR code on the
screen to connect with me.

00:34:06.910 --> 00:34:09.710
I would love to continue the conversation.

00:34:10.472 --> 00:34:16.025
Questions are welcome, and I'm happy
to talk about strategy, WordPress

00:34:16.029 --> 00:34:21.946
accessibility, or how to make the
business case inside your organization.

00:34:22.724 --> 00:34:27.709
For us, our goal is to have
conversations that identify mutual

00:34:27.709 --> 00:34:32.342
needs, and if we can't fill them with
excellence, we'll find someone who can.

00:34:33.524 --> 00:34:37.141
Feel free to use me as a
